					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TRANSFORM\n\nThe Transform node is one of the most used nodes in Wire as it allows you to rotate, scale and move your shapes, textures, slices and meshes around.\n\nShapes and Meshes work in normalized space (aspect  ratio).\nTextures and Slices operate in pixel space (resolution).\n"
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 182.49090576171875,
					"width": 661.3009033203125,
					"x": 77.21636199951171875,
					"y": 56.93471527099609375
				},
				"class": {
