					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: SCALING A SHAPE\n\nIn this example we are scaling a Star shape.\nBecause this is a shape we scale on both X and Y at the same time.\nGiving the scale a negative value inverts the shape."
